xCell><mxCell id="c130" value="Relief valve" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="467" y="962" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c131" value="Process line" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="107" y="1002" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c132" value="Electrical signal" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="287" y="1002" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c133" value="Trip / ESD / relief" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="467" y="1002" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c134" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#5a6b85;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="925" width="600" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c135" value="Notes" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="924" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c136" value="1. PSV-100A/B: mechanical top bleeders, set 2.2 barg, outside the control system." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=7.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="942" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c137" value="2. XY-102 de-energises to dump the vane-actuator hydraulics: stator vanes close fast (trip)." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=7.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="954" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c138" value="3. Trip solenoids XY-101/102, XY-201A/B and CB-101 trip are driven by interlocks: see C&amp;E." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=7.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="966" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c139" value="4. PY-201 selects the bypass output (split range / PIC-201 / trip feedforward with tracking)." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=7.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="978" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c140" value="   PIC-201 (variant b): PV = PY-100V, SP = PIC-100 SP + offset; software links not drawn." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=7.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="990" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c141" value="5. PY-101 selects the vane output: SIC-101 with CB-101 open, PY-100S vane share in loading/running." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=7.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="1002" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c142" value="6. CB-101 I/O: CLS, TRP, ST; SYN-101 (25), GRID-101, GP-101 (86G). HMI: HS-101 to HS-104." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=7.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="635" y="1014" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c143" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#5a6b85;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="925" width="420" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c144" value="Simplified P&amp;ID - TRT top-pressure control" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1255" y="932" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c145" value="Independent educational project - illustrative only" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=8.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1255" y="956" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c146" value="Not for construction" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=8.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1255" y="972" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c147" value="Rev C" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;fontSize=8.5;fontColor=#1f2a44;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1255" y="990" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>